    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kimodameshi Golf Club (a.k.a. \u201cKimogol\u201d) is a very ordinary club that can be found anywhere in a certain university.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are a group of young people who love golf and haunted places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player controls them and just plays golf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD to make the character walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift + WASD to make the character run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click the mouse when the player is close to the ball to prepare for the shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click again to hit the shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hit an OB or land in the water, the ghost will chase you, so you must run to a locker and wait for the ghost to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are caught by the ghost, you will be cursed on your next shot as a penalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*There are currently two playable stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Contains sudden loud noises and violent scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The objective is not to solve ghostly phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently under development and the number of stages will be increased in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer is available only in private matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be distributed on video distribution sites by both individuals and corporations. You may also monetize the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kimodameshi Golf Club (a.k.a. \u201cKimogol\u201d) is a very ordinary club that can be found anywhere in a certain university.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are a group of young people who love golf and haunted places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player controls them and just plays golf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD to make the character walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift + WASD to make the character run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click the mouse when the player is close to the ball to prepare for the shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click again to hit the shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hit an OB or land in the water, the ghost will chase you, so you must run to a locker and wait for the ghost to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are caught by the ghost, you will be cursed on your next shot as a penalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*There are currently two playable stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Contains sudden loud noises and violent scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The objective is not to solve ghostly phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently under development and the number of stages will be increased in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer is available only in private matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be distributed on video distribution sites by both individuals and corporations. You may also monetize the game.</p>",
